# 2026-10-05 14:06:24.674014
+Modify ratelimit.py to differentiate between authenticated and anonymous clients. Use request.state.user (set by auth middleware) to detect authenticated users; fallback to IP. Maintain separate counters for each client identifier (user ID or IP). Allow different rate limit configurations for authenticated vs anonymous (default to same as original). Keep the middleware excluding /health path. Update headers to reflect the limit and remaining for the applied config.

